# Normalize text files to LF in the repo regardless of the developer's OS.
# Without this, Windows checkouts with `core.autocrlf=true` keep showing
# files (e.g. src-tauri/Cargo.toml) as "modified" even when there's no
# real diff — Git is just warning that LF→CRLF would happen next touch.
# Pinning eol=lf in .gitattributes overrides that behavior per repo.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
